 OF THE STRIKE, BUT DID NOT INCLUDE INFORMATION ON THE MARGIN OF THE VOTE. OFFICIALS WITH UAW LOCAL 31, WHICH REPRESENTS THE LOCAL GM PLANT, COULD NOT IMMEDIATELY BE REACHED FOR COMMENT. THE CONTRACT INCLUDES AN $11,000 SIGNING BONUS, PERFORMANCE BONUSES, TWO 3% ANNUAL RAISES AND TWO 4% LUMP-SUM PAYMENTS, ACCORDING TO THE UAW WEBSITE. BUT THE END OF THE GM STRIKE DOESN'T MEAN THE KANSAS CITY AREA IS IN THE CLEAR. THE UNION NOW WILL USE THE GM AGREEMENT AS A TEMPLATE FOR NEGOTIATIONS WITH FORD MOTOR CO., WHOSE KANSAS CITY ASSEMBLY PLANT IN CLAYCOMO EMPLOYS ROUGHLY 6,600 - MAKING IT THE LARGEST MANUFACTURER IN THE AREA. THE GM FAIRFAX ASSEMBLY & STAMPING PLANT EMPLOYS 2,177."}{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00', 'title': 'AGENUS INC. HAS FILED A SHELF REGISTRATION IN THE AMOUNT OF $28.333333 MILLION.', 'text': 'AGENUS INC. HAS FILED A SHELF REGISTRATION IN THE AMOUNT OF $28.333333 MILLION.\n\nSECURITY NAME: COMMON STOCK\nSECURITIES OFFERED: 11,111,111'}{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2019-10-24 18:30:00', 'title': 'GILEAD SCIENCES INC POSTS Q3 LOSS PER SHARE OF $0.92', 'text': 'Q3 GAAP LOSS OF $0.92 PER SHARE.Q3 NON-GAAP DILUTED EPS OF $1.75 PER SHARE.REVISED FULL YEAR 2019 GUIDANCE.Q3 PRODUCT SALES OF $5.5 BILLION.TOTAL REVENUES WERE $5.6 BILLION FOR Q3 OF 2019 COMPARED TO $5.6 BILLION.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.74, REVENUE VIEW $5.61 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.NET LOSS FOR Q3 INCLUDES UP-FRONT COLLABORATION AND LICENSING EXPENSES OF $3.92 BILLION, OR $2.40 PER SHARE.SEES FY PRODUCT SALES $21,800 MILLION - $22,100 MILLION.GILEAD - REAFFIRM FORECAST ON FY EARNINGS PER SHARE IMPACT OF ACQUISITION-RELATED, UP-FRONT COLLABORATION AND LICENSING, STOCK-BASED COMPENSATION AND OTHER EXPENSES.Q3 HIV PRODUCT SALES $4.2 BILLION COMPARED TO $3.7 BILLION.Q3 CHRONIC HEPATITIS C VIRUS PRODUCT SALES WERE $674 MILLION VERSUS $902 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2019-10-24 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE GOLDMAN SACHS GROUP, INC. PRESENTS AT HEALTH CARE SERVICES PRIVATE E